WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.167
[Upbeat electronic music; a glass chime as a day bar is tapped and fills]

00:04.167 --> 00:08.125
[Cards land on the beat, a whoosh, then bubbling plucks and a bright goal chime]

00:08.125 --> 00:12.500
[A wash of water; rising notes as seven days are checked; a riser builds]

00:12.500 --> 00:16.667
[A deep impact on the logo; the final chord rings out]
